# PulseCredit environment variables
#
# The live demo requires NO API keys — the entire pipeline runs on keyless,
# public-domain U.S. government endpoints:
#   - FRED fredgraph CSV endpoint (Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis)
#   - CFPB Consumer Complaint Database trends API
#
# Regenerate all data artifacts with:  npm run data   (python3 scripts/build_index.py)
#
# No secrets are needed to build, run, or reproduce this project.
